CNN From Scratch — Full Detailed Walkthrough

This walkthrough explains the CNN implementation file-by-file in the exact order data flows through the network.

The goal is not just:

* what the code does

but:

* why it exists
* what mathematical idea it represents
* what shape transformations happen
* how information and gradients flow
* why deep learning frameworks are built this way

⸻

Big Picture First

Our CNN currently looks like:

Input Image
→ Conv1
→ ReLU1
→ Pool1
→ Conv2
→ ReLU2
→ Pool2
→ Flatten
→ Dense
→ Softmax + CrossEntropy Loss

Backward pass reverses this exactly:

Loss
← Dense
← Pool2
← ReLU2
← Conv2
← Pool1
← ReLU1
← Conv1

This reversal exists because of:

chain rule

which is the mathematical foundation of backpropagation.

